Customer Search on Costco Web and Mobile - 
Search API is called whenever the customer initiates a search on the website or mobile app
1. Search by License plate - License Plate and State
2. Search by Vehicle - Year, Make, Model, Trim (each of the values depend on previous one being entered, for example, Year before Make)
3. Search by size - Width, Aspect, Rim
   - option to add different rear tire for staggered fitment
4. Search by item # - item#, part #

Filter Parameters on PLP:
Price range
Promotion (on/off)
Brand 
Season
Compatibility
Run Flat
Load Index
Speed Rating

Sorting on PLP:
Best Match
Top Selling
Price: Low to High
Price: High to Low
UTQG: High to Low
Promotion